{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cf5f42cb0b83583b26327f9e633d0a12b969b14ff633d51c15e20dec58217517", "ja": "（初ステージ以降、麗花は様々なオーディションに\n挑戦しているが、中々思うような結果が出ない……）", "zh": "（初次登台后，丽花一直在挑战各种各样的试镜，可始终没能取得理想的结果……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "ee795ab30b511fc3d5b68df690ebf7e92b313e882c20c800f3eefbd4121ecd16", "ja": "オーディション、落ちちゃいましたね。\n残念だな～。", "zh": "试镜落选了呢。\n真遗憾啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1002_p", "source_sha256": "10cdf2d2423a941364bad8f618f3d20c6e3526a5601ddb4d163487cf803952bc", "ja": "ああ。ディレクターさんの反応も悪くなかったし、\n今回は絶対にいける！って思ったんだけど……。", "zh": "啊。导演的反应也不差，\n我还以为这次肯定能行！可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1003_p", "source_sha256": "16c8868cd0444e7dff73dc98be46a3855c7b6af1ed197fc38a1619d05bc1c298", "ja": "応募先が合ってなかったのかな……うーん。\nプロデュース方針を立て直さないと……。", "zh": "是不是应征的对象不太合适呢……唔。\n得重新制定制作方针了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "136f51c36e2b671c6d29c7e1bcaa9acc9d3d5f54490f6c637c5bc5f6801b98b2", "ja": "そうかもしれませんね。\n仕方ありません、次、がんばりましょう！", "zh": "也许是这样吧。\n没办法，接下来一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "fa835773d2bc3d3f1cdd8fc91bace923df2ac512b23388d2f5fdf30903538432", "ja": "というわけで……{$P$}さん、\nパンをどうぞ♪", "zh": "所以说……{$P$}先生，请吃面包♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f0fa090ad73dd43ae23dd26301bfaf955ae97fb1a96bcaf17ac09fa7839412cb", "ja": "えっ？　ありがとう。\n……でも、どうしていきなりパンを？", "zh": "咦？谢谢。\n……不过，为什么突然给我面包？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "950aefef59e9a346fc2b9f9893a8afeadc913660ce1f0f1a2e42ec4934753157", "ja": "{$P$}さん、なんだか元気が\nないみたいでしたから。お腹が空いたのかな？って。", "zh": "因为{$P$}先生看起来\n好像没什么精神嘛。我就在想是不是肚子饿了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "672452ea59f66b31e452646c23636bc0266b59a65f20c700915ba7e4962e638f", "ja": "朝ごはんは、ちゃんと食べてこなくちゃダメですよ！\nあっ、でもこれはパンなので、朝ごパンですね♪", "zh": "早饭一定要好好吃才行！\n啊，不过这是面包，所以算是早饭包呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "be85eb62c89197471ac319fe97b70b9d5dbe783b836046a0c9d94554f63e5431", "ja": "駅前のパン屋さんで、2番目に人気のパンを\n買ってきました！　これを食べて、元気出しましょう！", "zh": "我去车站前的面包店买了人气第2名的面包！吃了这个，打起精神来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1010_p", "source_sha256": "12b6d11d3ae7180a3125fe0849ab3aa397f283d19158f53436e63920c0d755de", "ja": "（もしかして、慰められているのか？　アイドルに\n気を遣わせるなんて、プロデューサー失格だな……）", "zh": "（难道是在安慰我吗？居然让偶像替我操心，我真是不配当制作人……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1011_p", "source_sha256": "82a1629c3e7c2619ea1eae90253bfd890e4fedaa12eef1e4046ed37f99a23cfd", "ja": "（いや、落ち込んでいる場合じゃないな。\nしかし方針変更と言っても……）", "zh": "（不，现在可不是消沉的时候。\n不过，就算要改变方针……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1012_se", "source_sha256": "b12709ece634544d32af67a926a9d0555729b694be2ce9963a7d8ef771034632", "ja": "プルルルル……", "zh": "嘟噜噜噜噜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "13acb7a35b52b8245613e5a366c574aad36d9a57d0ec4aa703393b0476a875ae", "ja": "{$P$}さん、携帯が鳴ってますよ！\n今度は、楽しいお知らせかもしれませんね♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，您手机响了哦！\n这次说不定是令人开心的消息呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1014_p", "source_sha256": "cf1e7bb6d1414d7c49855880fb57a3953d410cb5edefceaa298f78facbe86728", "ja": "それならいいんだけど……はい、もしもし。あっ、\n先日はお世話に……えっ？　うちの北上をですか！？", "zh": "那就好了……喂，您好。啊，前些日子承蒙关照……诶？您说的是我们家的北上吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1016_p", "source_sha256": "3b62f07b1dfa5bcaac1d8b1483c982069ebfdae7a65c42fc4dd9783bf0abdaed", "ja": "はい……はい。\nすぐに確認して折り返します！　はい、失礼します！", "zh": "好的……好的。\n我马上确认后再回复您！好的，失礼了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "7b36323ff023643204e6c765628f6d2cacb25ebe53c192730faeb8cc34444291", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\n北上って私のことですよね！　どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n您说的北上是指我吧！请问有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1018_p", "source_sha256": "e65a573dc2421a76409ab2156b33e8200f353ef2d32cd190fbccda03e6e89b16", "ja": "ああ。この前のオーディションのディレクターさんが、\n脇役でもよければ、ドラマに出てみないかって……。", "zh": "啊。前几天试镜的导演说，如果不介意演配角，要不要来电视剧里试试……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1019_p", "source_sha256": "44fbe88a3e0bea7c448855c0ebbe72a81d1abc41735dadd75c3888729896f43c", "ja": "やったな、麗花！", "zh": "太好了，丽花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "b1638edd0114d4b0fe4e95a0c4a18538540f050d40c79bb39e814cbfbf719739", "ja": "本当ですか！？　わーいわーい、やったー！\nやります、絶対にやりたいです♪", "zh": "真的吗！？太好啦太好啦，成功啦！\n我会去做的，我一定想做♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "05320ac115676508a79829175f4bee311892b6046bc41ea81a6770e2504bff7e", "ja": "私もいよいよ、TVドラマ業界に進出ですね！\nえっへん♪", "zh": "我也终于要进军电视剧界了呢！\n嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1022_048rei", "source_sha256": "3ace182fc651f3fe01d73694b64885c800075d9df22216f694deae6c08d7139c", "ja": "それで{$P$}さん、\n私は何の役をやればいいんですか？", "zh": "那么，{$P$}先生，我该演什么角色呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1023_p", "source_sha256": "20a38d2db26941e4b17eccee095b1cff78599a38609dc3144760aa6e74841ccf", "ja": "今回、麗花の役は台本のここ……\n主演の女優さんに話しかける、通行人役だな。", "zh": "这次，丽花的角色是剧本里的这里……\n和主演女演员搭话的路人角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "784d44ba8a768b0f66b3e1835b49a1b9f1b7e9f1c3b2d088f6d7a19ab9d4d40f", "ja": "あっ、これですね！\n「こんにちは！　いいお天気ですね♪」", "zh": "啊，就是这个！\n“你好！今天天气真好呢♪”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1025_048rei", "source_sha256": "7c943d851a9fdee0add1a13a38c6cb2015d84d9efef78919517c41524affef86", "ja": "わぁ～。とっても普通で、いいセリフですね♪\nさっそく、練習しなくっちゃ！", "zh": "哇～。非常普通，是很棒的台词呢♪\n得赶快练习才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1026_048rei", "source_sha256": "e2aa5cfc05c31a662b9c5d8d38a5818095ec19842a55a833dc1bc3517d14487a", "ja": "「こんにちは！　いいお天気ですね♪\nこんな日は……歌いたくなっちゃいますね！」", "zh": "“你好！今天天气真好呢♪\n这种天气……就忍不住想唱歌了！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1027_p", "source_sha256": "adcef0f02cc4ce6f1eb7ef8f9d96da6d67189649898a7669e6b11be33ab1523f", "ja": "最初からアドリブはダメだぞ、麗花。アドリブを\n入れていいかどうかは、監督さんに確認してからだ。", "zh": "麗花，一开始就即兴发挥可不行。要不要加即兴内容，得先跟导演确认过才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1028_048rei", "source_sha256": "d7d6697d4d3f300a4f1bb740ca31e6b15780be2230db8499046f24d374df4007", "ja": "そうなんですか？　わかりました！\nじゃあ今回は、このセリフだけ練習しておきますね！", "zh": "是这样吗？明白了！\n那这次我就先只练习这句台词啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1029_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1030_p", "source_sha256": "9fcd77b923db0f3a5702b7da0aa3182b044b4e6eba4867f898488d3a3fa071e2", "ja": "（今日はいよいよ、例のドラマの撮影だ。\n麗花、緊張してないかな……）", "zh": "（今天终于要拍那部电视剧了。丽花，不知道她有没有紧张……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1031_p", "source_sha256": "62febfc324a74262c8dddfab8a9823e781e0dec89234f007b3ce72186b187787", "ja": "麗花……あれ、いないのか。\n……ん？　これは、麗花の台本？", "zh": "丽花……咦，人不在吗。\n……嗯？这是丽花的剧本？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1032_048rei", "source_sha256": "b863110e8f1143a4d06a8ff3e72ba0f815d88afe8480028d4c3710d82f325a9b", "ja": "「普通の通行人っぽく！」\n「←{$P$}さんを参考にしてみる？」", "zh": "“要像个普通的路人！”\n“←参考一下{$P$}先生？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1033_p", "source_sha256": "de9c5d6d1573054ad98b0e33c3b6848850c14cf662062d2c1aec621d4fc66510", "ja": "おお、いろいろ書き込んであるな。\n……落書きも多いけど。", "zh": "哦，写了不少东西啊。\n……不过涂鸦也挺多的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1034_048rei", "source_sha256": "b9a79e6919cb6996674b600f291e7e8cd031abf42bd191bc5ae0e11c3ac499d0", "ja": "「アドリブはだめ！　確認してから！」\n「←重要！」", "zh": "“不能即兴发挥！要确认过后再说！”\n“←重要！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1035_p", "source_sha256": "6d9a11bb8d7cb52191be0fc2fe95f35e7d6a6c90fdfedb28215191b4abfe343e", "ja": "うん、そうだな。……なんだ、\nちゃんとわかってるじゃないか。これなら……。", "zh": "嗯，说得对。……什么啊，原来你明白嘛。这样的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1036_048rei", "source_sha256": "161595ae67ff4a000d45229f725ba42e13c143208d3681251734cd814d8010c9", "ja": "ふんふんふ～ん……あれ？　\n{$P$}さん、それ私の台本ですよ？", "zh": "哼哼哼～……咦？\n{$P$}先生，那是我的剧本吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1037_048rei", "source_sha256": "b970317e862da400d9c4238dfa181b7740c3720b6c5c040993a48f9bccb2c03d", "ja": "もしかして……勝手に見ちゃったんですか？\nもう、ダメですよ！", "zh": "难道说……你擅自偷看了吗？\n真是的，不可以这样啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1038_p", "source_sha256": "8981727c2911246c83070a7aee1944f5f57975d5437677e8cfe5575131e88555", "ja": "あっ……ご、ごめん、麗花！\n台本が置いてあったから、つい……。", "zh": "啊……对、对不起，丽花！\n因为剧本就放在那里，所以一不小心就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1039_048rei", "source_sha256": "876ab086a54530a04a907dcc20c8fe12530363ddeba2ed9beface781802da41d", "ja": "乙女の台本を見るなんて、マナー違反です！\n絶対ダメですからね！", "zh": "偷看女孩子的剧本可是很没礼貌的行为！\n绝对不可以哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1040_p", "source_sha256": "e68f67e4eb0cbd38c74316972dd9a8429660ef18a1daa76f4d77264322d52ae4", "ja": "ああ、気をつけるよ。\nところで麗花、調子はどうだ？", "zh": "啊，我会注意的。\n对了，丽花，你状态怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1041_048rei", "source_sha256": "75969edae983adb350152b43371b833f21b8fffcb6e01f1f7ef445bd02eefb1b", "ja": "はい、バッチリです♪　今日はがんばって、\n普通の通行人してきちゃいますね！", "zh": "好的，状态棒极了♪　今天我会加油，去当个普通路人回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1042_048rei", "source_sha256": "74d266e97c2fc60cd7f86431a956ccf9c5de3147c79b277c21df691bfcbf4aa6", "ja": "通行人ができたら、今度は何の役ができるかな～？\nふふっ、楽しみです！", "zh": "演过路人之后，下次还能演什么角色呢～？嘿嘿，好期待呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1043_p", "source_sha256": "e215f3572975b9008f1a6032d2aa05d26be429b64f8bf2104c947c5788af175e", "ja": "（……そうだった。\n麗花には、目指すものがちゃんと見えている……）", "zh": "（……原来如此。\n丽花已经清楚地看到了自己想要追求的目标……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_048rei_005_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_048rei_005_1044_p", "source_sha256": "29c2f4fb63d7d522fc3509eeb8102099b23a6756e36377987a37e0f87aab1f06", "ja": "（しばらく、方針は変えずにいこう。麗花がなりたい\nアイドルになれるよう、道を作るのが俺の仕事だ！）", "zh": "（暂时先不改变方针吧。为丽花铺好道路，让她成为自己想成为的偶像，就是我的工作！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
